(4900050, 711874, 24454, '<td valign="top">Ohhhh yeah!   My vote to win blue.  Every aspect of this photo is perfect.  10</td>', 'Ohhhh yeah!   My vote to win blue.  Every aspect of this photo is perfect.  10', '2008-08-20 10:54:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4900051, 711291, 3087, '<td valign="top">Wow, what an amazing mural! And I like the contrast between that and the pile of rubbish and graffiti-ed door.</td>', 'Wow, what an amazing mural! And I like the contrast between that and the pile of rubbish and graffiti-ed door.', '2008-08-20 10:54:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4900056, 711265, 24454, '<td valign="top">A very striking, well done photo for this challenge.  Not voting, but wanted to comment and say I hope this does well, because it is one of the better ones in this challenge!   Good Luck!</td>', 'A very striking, well done photo for this challenge.  Not voting, but wanted to comment and say I hope this does well, because it is one of the better ones in this challenge!   Good Luck!', '2008-08-20 10:55:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4900057, 711938, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like this. I like the motion blurred people, with just a couple of feet still clear. I like the worn bricks, the dirty painted door, the tiles and textures. And the grainy black and white too.</td>', 'I like this. I like the motion blurred people, with just a couple of feet still clear. I like the worn bricks, the dirty painted door, the tiles and textures. And the grainy black and white too.', '2008-08-20 10:55:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4900077, 711216, 3087, '<td valign="top">Wow, nicely caught. Great job!</td>', 'Wow, nicely caught. Great job!', '2008-08-20 11:02:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4900081, 712133, 3087, '<td valign="top">What an intriguing image. With the lovely sharp reflection of the branches and leaves and the detail of the net curtain too, it takes a moment before one makes out the person peering out. I like it.</td>', 'What an intriguing image. With the lovely sharp reflection of the branches and leaves and the detail of the net curtain too, it takes a moment before one makes out the person peering out. I like it.', '2008-08-20 11:03:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4900087, 711218, 49954, '<td valign="top">A little closer would have helped.  For the door detail.</td>', 'A little closer would have helped.  For the door detail.', '2008-08-20 11:04:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4900090, 712118, 49954, '<td valign="top">Different angle is fresh.</td>', 'Different angle is fresh.', '2008-08-20 11:04:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4900093, 712325, 49954, '<td valign="top">Processing leaves a lot to be desired, sorry.</td>', 'Processing leaves a lot to be desired, sorry.', '2008-08-20 11:05:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4900096, 711367, 49954, '<td valign="top">Or PART of a red door.</td>', 'Or PART of a red door.', '2008-08-20 11:05:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4900107, 712241, 49954, '<td valign="top">Hey!  Built for people like me! :)</td>', 'Hey!  Built for people like me! :)', '2008-08-20 11:07:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4900108, 712077, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like the repetition of colours: yellow wall and blue door, blue wall and yellow door, blue coat and kind of yellowy pants and shoes, the golden plaqye on the wall is yellowy too...</td>', 'I like the repetition of colours: yellow wall and blue door, blue wall and yellow door, blue coat and kind of yellowy pants and shoes, the golden plaqye on the wall is yellowy too...', '2008-08-20 11:08:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4900109, 712204, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice punchy contrast black and white.</td>', 'Nice punchy contrast black and white.', '2008-08-20 11:08:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4900110, 711754, 3087, '<td valign="top">Wow, that''s a whole lot of amazing textures.</td>', 'Wow, that''s a whole lot of amazing textures.', '2008-08-20 11:08:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4900112, 711874, 3087, '<td valign="top">Wow, otherworldly. Beautiful. I like the areas of darkness that contrast with the light and all the wonderful patterns in brickwork and tiles.</td>', 'Wow, otherworldly. Beautiful. I like the areas of darkness that contrast with the light and all the wonderful patterns in brickwork and tiles.', '2008-08-20 11:09:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4900117, 711680, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like the two horizontal caps at top and bottom - the double yellow lines and the street sign. The worn paintword on the door, the items within the door window and on the windowsill, the variation in the brickwork, with the green moss at the bottom, the diamond shape of the drain cover... so many details to soak up. I like it a lot.</td>', 'I like the two horizontal caps at top and bottom - the double yellow lines and the street sign. The worn paintword on the door, the items within the door window and on the windowsill, the variation in the brickwork, with the green moss at the bottom, the diamond shape of the drain cover... so many details to soak up. I like it a lot.', '2008-08-20 11:11:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4900119, 712248, 3087, '<td valign="top">Eeeeek! That''s good. Scary, but good.</td>', 'Eeeeek! That''s good. Scary, but good.', '2008-08-20 11:11:30.000000', NULL, 1),
