(4900464, 712203, 97339, '<td valign="top">Really like this picture, the exposure is spot on and the toning works well. The composition and cropping of the photo is perfect.Well done!</td>', 'Really like this picture, the exposure is spot on and the toning works well. The composition and cropping of the photo is perfect.Well done!', '2008-08-20 14:26:42.000000', NULL, 1),
