(4901265, 712169, 94265, '<td valign="top">I''d give this a 7 if the view beyond the doors was perfectly centred, still a decent 6.</td>', 'I''d give this a 7 if the view beyond the doors was perfectly centred, still a decent 6.', '2008-08-20 21:47:34.000000', NULL, 1),
