(4902702, 712018, 85388, '<td valign="top">I am not sure if this meets a challenge that well, since the door is just a prop, but i am not gonna give you a lower score because of this. <br/> <br/>I really like the poses of the two girls, and the facial expressions are excellent.<br/> <br/>There are a couple things that take away from the photo though.<br/>The most obvious one is the harsh shadow on the door, perhaps a softer source of light would work better. <br/>The line on the right is slanted and makes the photo feel crooked. That could be fixed in any image editing software. <br/>The girls hand is also cut off, I''d like to see a bit more of it. <br/>And last and least, i can a see something on the back wall, which is distracting. That could''ve been fixed by a shallower DOF. <br/> <br/>Overall, it''s a really great shot!</td>', 'I am not sure if this meets a challenge that well, since the door is just a prop, but i am not gonna give you a lower score because of this.  I really like the poses of the two girls, and the facial expressions are excellent. There are a couple things that take away from the photo though.The most obvious one is the harsh shadow on the door, perhaps a softer source of light would work better. The line on the right is slanted and makes the photo feel crooked. That could be fixed in any image editing software. The girls hand is also cut off, I''d like to see a bit more of it. And last and least, i can a see something on the back wall, which is distracting. That could''ve been fixed by a shallower DOF.  Overall, it''s a really great shot!', '2008-08-21 14:15:41.000000', NULL, 1),
