(4904253, 711874, 62895, '<td valign="top">I like that you provide both entrance doors and exit doors along with a great perspective shot.</td>', 'I like that you provide both entrance doors and exit doors along with a great perspective shot.', '2008-08-22 10:43:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4904260, 712248, 62895, '<td valign="top">I like that shadow created by the back lighting. It creates a looming effect. The isolated door is a great idea. It seems like the lighting is a little too bright on the door, it''s almost too much contrast with the background.</td>', 'I like that shadow created by the back lighting. It creates a looming effect. The isolated door is a great idea. It seems like the lighting is a little too bright on the door, it''s almost too much contrast with the background.', '2008-08-22 10:48:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4904262, 711681, 62895, '<td valign="top">Great colors and blends. The photo is a little on the soft side though.</td>', 'Great colors and blends. The photo is a little on the soft side though.', '2008-08-22 10:49:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4904281, 712350, 62895, '<td valign="top">It looks like you have some distortion. To bad this challenge is only basic editing. j/k Actually it''s a great shot and I like the fisheye effect you used to squeeze two more doors in there. Great job!</td>', 'It looks like you have some distortion. To bad this challenge is only basic editing. j/k Actually it''s a great shot and I like the fisheye effect you used to squeeze two more doors in there. Great job!', '2008-08-22 11:00:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4904285, 711419, 62895, '<td valign="top">Clean image, strong lines, and a little minimalistic. You''ve done a good job of putting an interesting twist on the mundane.</td>', 'Clean image, strong lines, and a little minimalistic. You''ve done a good job of putting an interesting twist on the mundane.', '2008-08-22 11:02:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4904288, 712165, 62895, '<td valign="top">Those are some "wow" colors. The greens in the garden frame and complement the red doors very nicely.</td>', 'Those are some "wow" colors. The greens in the garden frame and complement the red doors very nicely.', '2008-08-22 11:03:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4904312, 712119, 62895, '<td valign="top">So much character and texture. Great colors and contrasts.</td>', 'So much character and texture. Great colors and contrasts.', '2008-08-22 11:16:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4904562, 711882, 62895, '<td valign="top">This door has character and class. I think a touch more contrast would have held develop the mood a little more.</td>', 'This door has character and class. I think a touch more contrast would have held develop the mood a little more.', '2008-08-22 13:46:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4904568, 712249, 62895, '<td valign="top">This is creative. I know when I first saw this challenge the images that came to my mind were the cliche old doors stuck in a wall somewhere, but this opens up a new set of possibilities. Way to do something different!</td>', 'This is creative. I know when I first saw this challenge the images that came to my mind were the cliche old doors stuck in a wall somewhere, but this opens up a new set of possibilities. Way to do something different!', '2008-08-22 13:48:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4904571, 712105, 62895, '<td valign="top">Normally direct sunlight is hard to work with, but your processing is great and the result is not harsh, but enchanting. Good work!</td>', 'Normally direct sunlight is hard to work with, but your processing is great and the result is not harsh, but enchanting. Good work!', '2008-08-22 13:50:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4904574, 712328, 62895, '<td valign="top">Good eye, and nice symmetry. 6</td>', 'Good eye, and nice symmetry. 6', '2008-08-22 13:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4904576, 712121, 62895, '<td valign="top">Nice use of framing. It really sets of the elegant door.</td>', 'Nice use of framing. It really sets of the elegant door.', '2008-08-22 13:52:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4904581, 711978, 62895, '<td valign="top">Wow, talk about mood. I love the obscure arches in the shadows, and the stairway framing the door.</td>', 'Wow, talk about mood. I love the obscure arches in the shadows, and the stairway framing the door.', '2008-08-22 13:55:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4904584, 711732, 9602, '<td valign="top">Nice color.</td>', 'Nice color.', '2008-08-22 13:56:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4904586, 711754, 62895, '<td valign="top">Surreal image. The colors and tonal changes are subtle and draw the eye in.</td>', 'Surreal image. The colors and tonal changes are subtle and draw the eye in.', '2008-08-22 13:57:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4904589, 712323, 62895, '<td valign="top">This is a great texture image, and the off kilter angle works for me.</td>', 'This is a great texture image, and the off kilter angle works for me.', '2008-08-22 13:58:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4904605, 711410, 85388, '<td valign="top">wonderful composition, but the colors are lacking just a bit</td>', 'wonderful composition, but the colors are lacking just a bit', '2008-08-22 14:05:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4904611, 711700, 43828, '<td valign="top">Nice set of Doors, A shot from strait in front of them would have help the veiw even if you had to lie down to clear a tree or patio, or stand on something to clear a railing. On that I could see these in sepia or B&amp;W also.</td>', 'Nice set of Doors, A shot from strait in front of them would have help the veiw even if you had to lie down to clear a tree or patio, or stand on something to clear a railing. On that I could see these in sepia or B&W also.', '2008-08-22 14:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4904620, 711945, 43828, '<td valign="top">This is a nice looking door, I think you could have even moved in alot closer to only capture the door and a trim of the block around it. this would have help with the blown out sky to. looks like theres a whole in the window, on a close up sepia or black and white that would add alot to the photo. HDR even.</td>', 'This is a nice looking door, I think you could have even moved in alot closer to only capture the door and a trim of the block around it. this would have help with the blown out sky to. looks like theres a whole in the window, on a close up sepia or black and white that would add alot to the photo. HDR even.', '2008-08-22 14:14:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4904624, 711928, 43828, '<td valign="top">Nice Doors, I think if you could have moved back just a bit from the door and kept the angle strait on and even. it would be like a ground up perspective</td>', 'Nice Doors, I think if you could have moved back just a bit from the door and kept the angle strait on and even. it would be like a ground up perspective', '2008-08-22 14:16:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4904628, 712351, 43828, '<td valign="top">I think I would have tryed the angle strait on with the door in the right hand rule of thirds. if you do reshoot I would like to see the results.</td>', 'I think I would have tryed the angle strait on with the door in the right hand rule of thirds. if you do reshoot I would like to see the results.', '2008-08-22 14:19:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4904629, 712089, 43828, '<td valign="top">I think this shot would have worked better if you cropped out the left side <br/>just leaving a trim of the blue and white wall in the shot. would have made it easier to straiten the side also. Nice industrial shot.</td>', 'I think this shot would have worked better if you cropped out the left side just leaving a trim of the blue and white wall in the shot. would have made it easier to straiten the side also. Nice industrial shot.', '2008-08-22 14:22:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4904633, 712012, 43828, '<td valign="top">seems like we are missing something in the shot, Could you have pulled back and got more stone work?</td>', 'seems like we are missing something in the shot, Could you have pulled back and got more stone work?', '2008-08-22 14:24:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4904635, 711434, 43828, '<td valign="top">Besides being to dark shots of Doors seem to work a little better strait on,<br/>Not always but most of the time,</td>', 'Besides being to dark shots of Doors seem to work a little better strait on,Not always but most of the time,', '2008-08-22 14:26:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4904644, 712020, 43828, '<td valign="top">Tough shot, I wander if you could have reangled to crop out the lower window <br/>but keep the upper window, fine line inbetween them. then drop the crop below the clump of over hang bricks above the upper window. Well if you deside to try it I would like to see the results.</td>', 'Tough shot, I wander if you could have reangled to crop out the lower window but keep the upper window, fine line inbetween them. then drop the crop below the clump of over hang bricks above the upper window. Well if you deside to try it I would like to see the results.', '2008-08-22 14:31:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4904646, 712036, 43828, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, Try it with a tripod more trigger time and straiten the left side up just a bit.</td>', 'Nice shot, Try it with a tripod more trigger time and straiten the left side up just a bit.', '2008-08-22 14:33:19.000000', NULL, 1);
