(4906341, 710930, 54228, '<td valign="top">The line leading up to the door really makes this one. I''d like to see an ''advanced edit'' with a big vignette to really bring the focus in on that door.</td>', 'The line leading up to the door really makes this one. I''d like to see an ''advanced edit'' with a big vignette to really bring the focus in on that door.', '2008-08-23 15:02:34.000000', NULL, 1),
