(4906362, 712139, 54228, '<td valign="top">Well exposed and framed. I guess you''ve got a few comments about it being a window, but I''ll give you the benefit of the doubt!</td>', 'Well exposed and framed. I guess you''ve got a few comments about it being a window, but I''ll give you the benefit of the doubt!', '2008-08-23 15:14:57.000000', NULL, 1),
