(4906497, 710979, 54228, '<td valign="top">What a great door! Points just for finding this one! I keep looking up at the lighter part of the iamge (the signs) and away from the door, which for this challenge doesn''t really suit, but that''s just a minor niggle.</td>', 'What a great door! Points just for finding this one! I keep looking up at the lighter part of the iamge (the signs) and away from the door, which for this challenge doesn''t really suit, but that''s just a minor niggle.', '2008-08-23 16:48:57.000000', NULL, 1),
