(4907116, 710472, 34337, '<td valign="top">Love the coloring of the house on the left.  I do think that the photo needs a little more to look at.</td>', 'Love the coloring of the house on the left.  I do think that the photo needs a little more to look at.', '2008-08-24 01:37:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4907119, 711819, 34337, '<td valign="top">I would like to see this photo w/out the white border.  Light border on a light background is tough to pull off.  LOVE the doors.  Very interesting to look at.</td>', 'I would like to see this photo w/out the white border.  Light border on a light background is tough to pull off.  LOVE the doors.  Very interesting to look at.', '2008-08-24 01:39:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4907121, 710566, 34337, '<td valign="top">Use a larger photo.  Better scores will follow.</td>', 'Use a larger photo.  Better scores will follow.', '2008-08-24 01:41:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4907127, 712328, 34337, '<td valign="top">Great use of black and white (or inverted colors/B&amp;W).  I feel like I want to be there.</td>', 'Great use of black and white (or inverted colors/B&W).  I feel like I want to be there.', '2008-08-24 01:44:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4907131, 712290, 34337, '<td valign="top">Horizon SEEMS off.  Could just be the house.  But I keep thinking it looks crooked for some reason.  Very interesting building and doors though.</td>', 'Horizon SEEMS off.  Could just be the house.  But I keep thinking it looks crooked for some reason.  Very interesting building and doors though.', '2008-08-24 01:46:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4907136, 712320, 34337, '<td valign="top">I would love to have seen this without the brick wall in the lower right.  Those doors and windows are soooo cool and the reflections make them even better.</td>', 'I would love to have seen this without the brick wall in the lower right.  Those doors and windows are soooo cool and the reflections make them even better.', '2008-08-24 01:52:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4907137, 711553, 34337, '<td valign="top">beautiful colors</td>', 'beautiful colors', '2008-08-24 01:53:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4907138, 712021, 34337, '<td valign="top">Contrast is riding the fence between just right and too much.  Love the shot and crop, and I do like the border on this one.  It grounds the photo nicely.</td>', 'Contrast is riding the fence between just right and too much.  Love the shot and crop, and I do like the border on this one.  It grounds the photo nicely.', '2008-08-24 01:54:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4907507, 711874, 70371, '<td valign="top">Impressive tonal range. I would like to see more of the open doorway. Crop is a little too tight for my taste, but still conveys the mood well. A little hot in the highlights. I''d like to see this in advanced editing.</td>', 'Impressive tonal range. I would like to see more of the open doorway. Crop is a little too tight for my taste, but still conveys the mood well. A little hot in the highlights. I''d like to see this in advanced editing.', '2008-08-24 11:29:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4907512, 712269, 70371, '<td valign="top">Contrast is maybe too high for this kind of textured shot. I''d like to see this cropped more on the right or less on the left to balance out the composition. When placing the composition focus so much to the center it''s better to go with a balanced crop around the subject. Overall very nice, reminds me of running around with my X-700 and a bulk-loader of Pan-F Plus. :)</td>', 'Contrast is maybe too high for this kind of textured shot. I''d like to see this cropped more on the right or less on the left to balance out the composition. When placing the composition focus so much to the center it''s better to go with a balanced crop around the subject. Overall very nice, reminds me of running around with my X-700 and a bulk-loader of Pan-F Plus. :)', '2008-08-24 11:33:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4907515, 712139, 70371, '<td valign="top">Gotta love natural frames, though I''m not sure if this would count more as a door than a "window". The brick is a bit too soft and the image could benefit from some curves adjustment.</td>', 'Gotta love natural frames, though I''m not sure if this would count more as a door than a "window". The brick is a bit too soft and the image could benefit from some curves adjustment.', '2008-08-24 11:34:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4907518, 711305, 70371, '<td valign="top">I love industrial settings. I''d like to see the contrast punched up some and the levels brought in so there is more solid black. The crop is too tight at the top and I''d go into the lens correction filter to try and straighten out some of the convergence going on. A bit soft as well.</td>', 'I love industrial settings. I''d like to see the contrast punched up some and the levels brought in so there is more solid black. The crop is too tight at the top and I''d go into the lens correction filter to try and straighten out some of the convergence going on. A bit soft as well.', '2008-08-24 11:38:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4907523, 711700, 70371, '<td valign="top">A tight shot like this may come across better in B&amp;W. If kept color I''d like to see more of the porch to give the doorway some breathing room. Nice textures and great colors.</td>', 'A tight shot like this may come across better in B&W. If kept color I''d like to see more of the porch to give the doorway some breathing room. Nice textures and great colors.', '2008-08-24 11:40:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4907524, 712006, 70371, '<td valign="top">Pushed the curves a bit too much. Almost reversed/solarized some of the tones when pushing the contrast so much. I''d like to see a tighter crop to get rid of the distracting horizontal line between the door frame and foundation. Good potential.</td>', 'Pushed the curves a bit too much. Almost reversed/solarized some of the tones when pushing the contrast so much. I''d like to see a tighter crop to get rid of the distracting horizontal line between the door frame and foundation. Good potential.', '2008-08-24 11:42:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4907527, 712180, 70371, '<td valign="top">Great juxtaposition of color/textures. The angled and tight crop stop me from being drawn in to take in all the little details/textures and contrast of colors splashed in the shot.</td>', 'Great juxtaposition of color/textures. The angled and tight crop stop me from being drawn in to take in all the little details/textures and contrast of colors splashed in the shot.', '2008-08-24 11:44:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4907532, 712338, 70371, '<td valign="top">GREAT angle, but too many distracting lines. I like the colors and the contrast has been handled very well.</td>', 'GREAT angle, but too many distracting lines. I like the colors and the contrast has been handled very well.', '2008-08-24 11:46:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4907534, 712119, 70371, '<td valign="top">I like the composition. I think maybe it would work better if you rotated the shot 180 Degrees. Seems a little soft for this kind of texture work. I''d like to see it with some curves adjustment to bring out more contrast.</td>', 'I like the composition. I think maybe it would work better if you rotated the shot 180 Degrees. Seems a little soft for this kind of texture work. I''d like to see it with some curves adjustment to bring out more contrast.', '2008-08-24 11:48:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4907537, 712027, 70371, '<td valign="top">My eyes! Wow on the color saturation! Boost up the sharpening and add a bit more contrast to make the shingles pop.</td>', 'My eyes! Wow on the color saturation! Boost up the sharpening and add a bit more contrast to make the shingles pop.', '2008-08-24 11:50:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4907538, 712222, 70371, '<td valign="top">GREAT location. I''m jealous.</td>', 'GREAT location. I''m jealous.', '2008-08-24 11:52:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4907541, 711291, 70371, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see a wider crop and the colors to pop more. Try this little trick. In photoshop convert the image to LAB color, then Apply Image in Soft Light at about 80% opacity. Test the different color channels in the Apply Image dialogue to pick the best "pop". Great location. Perfect content contrast.</td>', 'I''d like to see a wider crop and the colors to pop more. Try this little trick. In photoshop convert the image to LAB color, then Apply Image in Soft Light at about 80% opacity. Test the different color channels in the Apply Image dialogue to pick the best "pop". Great location. Perfect content contrast.', '2008-08-24 11:55:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4907547, 710566, 70371, '<td valign="top">Needed a good explanation of why you were snapping nekkid shots? Been there. Straighten the vertical lines, add a curves adjustment to bring the contrast into check. Too little contrast, no solid blacks and looks a bit soft on focus.</td>', 'Needed a good explanation of why you were snapping nekkid shots? Been there. Straighten the vertical lines, add a curves adjustment to bring the contrast into check. Too little contrast, no solid blacks and looks a bit soft on focus.', '2008-08-24 11:57:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4907548, 711647, 70371, '<td valign="top">GREAT location. I''m jealous.</td>', 'GREAT location. I''m jealous.', '2008-08-24 11:57:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4907550, 712326, 70371, '<td valign="top">I want to paint it black.</td>', 'I want to paint it black.', '2008-08-24 11:58:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4907828, 711129, 30982, '<td valign="top">Simple and to the point.  I quite like it.</td>', 'Simple and to the point.  I quite like it.', '2008-08-24 15:15:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4907829, 711011, 30982, '<td valign="top">Simple and clean.  And yes, it''s the answer.  Who knew?</td>', 'Simple and clean.  And yes, it''s the answer.  Who knew?', '2008-08-24 15:15:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4907830, 712101, 30982, '<td valign="top">Wow - expert craftsmanship on that door!  Nice unique interpretation of the challenge, too.</td>', 'Wow - expert craftsmanship on that door!  Nice unique interpretation of the challenge, too.', '2008-08-24 15:15:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4907832, 711548, 30982, '<td valign="top">Looks like some very high end real estate!  Cool gate!</td>', 'Looks like some very high end real estate!  Cool gate!', '2008-08-24 15:16:15.000000', NULL, 1),
