(4907861, 712242, 30982, '<td valign="top">Has a wonderful "English afternoon" feel to it, whether it be "English" or not.  Very nicely composed - nicely balanced to me.</td>', 'Has a wonderful "English afternoon" feel to it, whether it be "English" or not.  Very nicely composed - nicely balanced to me.', '2008-08-24 15:27:27.000000', NULL, 1),
