(4910788, 712121, 97796, '<td valign="top">Although I am not at all an experienced photographer, I like this picture a lot. It kinda looks like something that should be on the front of a magazine. I ''m not good enough to go and point out all the flaws, and so on... But I DO know that to the untrained eye, this picture looks quite elegant!</td>', 'Although I am not at all an experienced photographer, I like this picture a lot. It kinda looks like something that should be on the front of a magazine. I ''m not good enough to go and point out all the flaws, and so on... But I DO know that to the untrained eye, this picture looks quite elegant!', '2008-08-25 21:08:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4911092, 712077, 96957, '<td valign="top">Very nice. A little oversaturated, but very nice subject. The image could also be sharper -- I''m guessing you have taken this picture as far as your camera/lens will let you.</td>', 'Very nice. A little oversaturated, but very nice subject. The image could also be sharper -- I''m guessing you have taken this picture as far as your camera/lens will let you.', '2008-08-25 22:54:04.000000', NULL, 1),
