(4911158, 712138, 96957, '<td valign="top">Lovely and creative. WIth a little more sharpness and color adjustment, it would look like it belonged among Reuters'' pictures of the week. 8</td>', 'Lovely and creative. WIth a little more sharpness and color adjustment, it would look like it belonged among Reuters'' pictures of the week. 8', '2008-08-25 23:09:35.000000', NULL, 1),
