(4916069, 712320, 30982, '<td valign="top">I thought it was pretty cool, particularly the illusion (?) that there''s a door made up of a brick wall and a brass handle reflected in the middle panel.</td>', 'I thought it was pretty cool, particularly the illusion (?) that there''s a door made up of a brick wall and a brass handle reflected in the middle panel.', '2008-08-27 18:53:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(4916077, 712203, 30982, '<td valign="top">You owe Kolasi five comments.  :-)  I''d never have figured that out.  Sad little place - I like that you can just see a sliver of the area beyond through the door, through the window.</td>', 'You owe Kolasi five comments.  :-)  I''d never have figured that out.  Sad little place - I like that you can just see a sliver of the area beyond through the door, through the window.', '2008-08-27 18:55:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(4916089, 711874, 85063, '<td valign="top">Félicitations pour le 1er ruban ! Il y en aura d''autres... C''est une très belle photo et le noir et blanc était une bonne idée :)</td>', 'Félicitations pour le 1er ruban ! Il y en aura d''autres... C''est une très belle photo et le noir et blanc était une bonne idée :)', '2008-08-27 18:59:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(4916282, 712300, 7810, '<td valign="top">This is awesome. I love this image ... the texture, the colour, the balance ...congrats on the well deserved high placement and PB.</td>', 'This is awesome. I love this image ... the texture, the colour, the balance ...congrats on the well deserved high placement and PB.', '2008-08-27 20:04:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(4916307, 712066, 50641, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Great shot and nice score!  Don and I saw a fire escape with a door and a shadow and we thought it was a very melethia shot :)  Unfortunately, nothing I could do to the photo would make it look like one of yours in the end.  You really oughta write a tutorial or something.  ''On Melethiality''</td>', 'Wow!  Great shot and nice score!  Don and I saw a fire escape with a door and a shadow and we thought it was a very melethia shot :)  Unfortunately, nothing I could do to the photo would make it look like one of yours in the end.  You really oughta write a tutorial or something.  ''On Melethiality''', '2008-08-27 20:12:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(4916314, 712285, 30982, '<td valign="top">Great shot - I like how the door and doorway is used to show us more than just a door - the view is lovely!  I also very much appreciate the details you came back to provide after the challenge.  I''d not have known you used a flash so you did it well, in my opinion.  Congrats on an excellent placement in this challenge!</td>', 'Great shot - I like how the door and doorway is used to show us more than just a door - the view is lovely!  I also very much appreciate the details you came back to provide after the challenge.  I''d not have known you used a flash so you did it well, in my opinion.  Congrats on an excellent placement in this challenge!', '2008-08-27 20:16:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(4916320, 712248, 30982, '<td valign="top">TOP TEN!!!  WOO HOO!!!  Congrats!  You picked the right one for DPC, but I still think Dog Door is a hoot and a half.  I also really like the fisheye shots, too.  VERY creative idea - very pleased to see it paid off for you, too!</td>', 'TOP TEN!!!  WOO HOO!!!  Congrats!  You picked the right one for DPC, but I still think Dog Door is a hoot and a half.  I also really like the fisheye shots, too.  VERY creative idea - very pleased to see it paid off for you, too!', '2008-08-27 20:18:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(4916333, 710707, 86447, '<td valign="top">Adorable bunny.   I think the lack of a traditional ''door'' hurt you on the score, though.   DPC voters are sometimes quite literal.</td>', 'Adorable bunny.   I think the lack of a traditional ''door'' hurt you on the score, though.   DPC voters are sometimes quite literal.', '2008-08-27 20:21:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(4916342, 711978, 7810, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the blue for this rich image. <br/>Love the tone.</td>', 'Congrats on the blue for this rich image. Love the tone.', '2008-08-27 20:26:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(4916386, 711776, 51424, '<td valign="top">I did not have time to vote and I am really sorry about that because this is a ten to me. I wish you had placed higher, but you still should be proud of this lovely photo!</td>', 'I did not have time to vote and I am really sorry about that because this is a ten to me. I wish you had placed higher, but you still should be proud of this lovely photo!', '2008-08-27 20:43:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(4916484, 712066, 48228, '<td valign="top">I has a feeling this may be yours, but nit completely sure, and I think it is a very strong impact image that works.<br/>I also like your outtakes.....</td>', 'I has a feeling this may be yours, but nit completely sure, and I think it is a very strong impact image that works.I also like your outtakes.....', '2008-08-27 21:25:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(4916491, 710707, 61315, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments and the 114 voters that liked it enough to rate it 5 or above, else I''d have the "brown" ribbon! I knew that this wasn''t going to go over with the "literal" minded but I thought Mr. Bunny was so dang cute I had to enter him. :-)</td>', 'Thanks for the comments and the 114 voters that liked it enough to rate it 5 or above, else I''d have the "brown" ribbon! I knew that this wasn''t going to go over with the "literal" minded but I thought Mr. Bunny was so dang cute I had to enter him. :-)', '2008-08-27 21:32:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(4916621, 712066, 43565, '<td valign="top">Congratulations!  I like the way the diagonal line of the stairs leads me from one door to the other.</td>', 'Congratulations!  I like the way the diagonal line of the stairs leads me from one door to the other.', '2008-08-27 22:31:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(4916642, 711874, 70514, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on not only a stunning image, a wonderful score, but the bonus of a ribbon!  Well deserved.  I love this picture, but was surprised at the original.  It really (in my opinion) lacks the massive impact you gave it by converting it. Great eye!  Wonderful image.</td>', 'Congratulations on not only a stunning image, a wonderful score, but the bonus of a ribbon!  Well deserved.  I love this picture, but was surprised at the original.  It really (in my opinion) lacks the massive impact you gave it by converting it. Great eye!  Wonderful image.', '2008-08-27 22:39:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(4916644, 712066, 70514, '<td valign="top">So cool.  I can imagine this in a magazine or photo book somewhere.  Wonderful score and placement, congratulations!</td>', 'So cool.  I can imagine this in a magazine or photo book somewhere.  Wonderful score and placement, congratulations!', '2008-08-27 22:41:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(4916647, 712066, 83313, '<td valign="top">Wow, this did great for you, and you probably did choose the one that did better in voting! To be honest though, I like your outtake "sliding doors" better. But then everyone has different tastes, and the voting curve always reflects that.</td>', 'Wow, this did great for you, and you probably did choose the one that did better in voting! To be honest though, I like your outtake "sliding doors" better. But then everyone has different tastes, and the voting curve always reflects that.', '2008-08-27 22:42:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(4916649, 712222, 70514, '<td valign="top">What fun!  The figure took me a second, but that was it.  Such a yummy dessert to an already wonderful image.</td>', 'What fun!  The figure took me a second, but that was it.  Such a yummy dessert to an already wonderful image.', '2008-08-27 22:43:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(4916657, 711844, 70514, '<td valign="top">I agree with your comments (the good parts, not the bombing parts).  It''s sad to see how scoring is playing out these days.  <br/> <br/>Lovely image with great lighting and a nice mix of textures and colors.</td>', 'I agree with your comments (the good parts, not the bombing parts).  It''s sad to see how scoring is playing out these days.   Lovely image with great lighting and a nice mix of textures and colors.', '2008-08-27 22:45:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(4916658, 711978, 30982, '<td valign="top">VERY pleased to see this do well!  Congratulations on the blue for this excellent photograph.</td>', 'VERY pleased to see this do well!  Congratulations on the blue for this excellent photograph.', '2008-08-27 22:46:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(4916704, 712066, 37961, '<td valign="top">Red geometric designs are always a hit with me. Love it.</td>', 'Red geometric designs are always a hit with me. Love it.', '2008-08-27 23:05:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(4916756, 711978, 26464, '<td valign="top">nice detail</td>', 'nice detail', '2008-08-27 23:22:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(4916822, 711925, 90474, '<td valign="top">Well done, a very good photo.  My grand kids love the place as well.</td>', 'Well done, a very good photo.  My grand kids love the place as well.', '2008-08-27 23:48:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(4916992, 710927, 67444, '<td valign="top">congrats andrewt on a top ten finished. =&gt;</td>', 'congrats andrewt on a top ten finished. =>', '2008-08-28 00:47:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(4917433, 711874, 30982, '<td valign="top">Hey, HUGE congrats on the ribbon!  (And my favorite color of ribbon at that!)  You''ve got more than just good photography chops - you have a great eye and a great sense of what makes an interesting photograph.  Very pleased to see it rewarded here.  I also thank you for the added words of explanation about the place.  Looks to be a wonderful place to visit.  Now go find a nice place to hang that shiny ribbon on your wall!</td>', 'Hey, HUGE congrats on the ribbon!  (And my favorite color of ribbon at that!)  You''ve got more than just good photography chops - you have a great eye and a great sense of what makes an interesting photograph.  Very pleased to see it rewarded here.  I also thank you for the added words of explanation about the place.  Looks to be a wonderful place to visit.  Now go find a nice place to hang that shiny ribbon on your wall!', '2008-08-28 08:11:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(4917662, 711978, 3936, '<td valign="top">Wow!  What a great image...  This one is one of the best in the last several challenges put together.  The top photos are always very good.  But the difference to me is, how long can I just sit and look at the one image?  Could I see it hanging on my wall for a week? A month?  A year?  Longer?<br/> <br/>This is one of those that I do not tire.  I love the texture, the way the light sets the scene, the tones, the play of the shadows.  The image draws the viewer in, and invites the watcher to invent their own story.  Photos that spark not only the interest of the viewer, but also the imagination, are not an every day occurance.<br/> <br/>Congratulations on a very well deserved first place finish.</td>', 'Wow!  What a great image...  This one is one of the best in the last several challenges put together.  The top photos are always very good.  But the difference to me is, how long can I just sit and look at the one image?  Could I see it hanging on my wall for a week? A month?  A year?  Longer? This is one of those that I do not tire.  I love the texture, the way the light sets the scene, the tones, the play of the shadows.  The image draws the viewer in, and invites the watcher to invent their own story.  Photos that spark not only the interest of the viewer, but also the imagination, are not an every day occurance. Congratulations on a very well deserved first place finish.', '2008-08-28 11:31:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(4917850, 711882, 52115, '<td valign="top">That''s a nice antique looking door.<br/>If I did a door it would have some Clown Eyes peering out, or through the glass.</td>', 'That''s a nice antique looking door.If I did a door it would have some Clown Eyes peering out, or through the glass.', '2008-08-28 13:33:04.000000', NULL, 0),
