(4922231, 711680, 86447, '<td valign="top">I really like all of the shapes/angles here.  Congrats on top ten finish!</td>', 'I really like all of the shapes/angles here.  Congrats on top ten finish!', '2008-08-30 22:19:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(4922509, 711978, 11078, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your Blue Ribbon an excellent shot</td>', 'Congrats on your Blue Ribbon an excellent shot', '2008-08-31 01:04:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(4923446, 712077, 36060, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the 4th place. Excellent shot!</td>', 'Congrats on the 4th place. Excellent shot!', '2008-08-31 19:11:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(4923448, 711826, 36060, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the 5th place. Great shot!</td>', 'Congrats on the 5th place. Great shot!', '2008-08-31 19:11:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(4923449, 712300, 36060, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the 6th place. Excellent shot!</td>', 'Congrats on the 6th place. Excellent shot!', '2008-08-31 19:12:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(4924412, 711890, 96751, '<td valign="top">Thank you for your comment outafocus.  Late to the party, this was from another shoot I did that fell inside the challenge dates.  Not my best shot, but wanted to participate :-)</td>', 'Thank you for your comment outafocus.  Late to the party, this was from another shoot I did that fell inside the challenge dates.  Not my best shot, but wanted to participate :-)', '2008-09-01 03:01:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(4927109, 710927, 68504, '<td valign="top">I am so enjoying looking at this.  The colours make me realize why they are so used in the Buddhist tradition; the composition is simple and strong, reflecting the architecture which makes such good use of proportion and materials. Your beautiful daughter sets off the solidity of structure, and brings it into the human dimension.</td>', 'I am so enjoying looking at this.  The colours make me realize why they are so used in the Buddhist tradition; the composition is simple and strong, reflecting the architecture which makes such good use of proportion and materials. Your beautiful daughter sets off the solidity of structure, and brings it into the human dimension.', '2008-09-02 02:27:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(4931118, 711874, 97166, '<td valign="top">Did you use a lens correction tool for the edges or something?</td>', 'Did you use a lens correction tool for the edges or something?', '2008-09-03 12:14:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(4931167, 712077, 12661, '<td valign="top">Let me be the first to say, congrats on <b>3rd</b> place. A well deserved first ribbon.<br/> <br/>ETA: As an aside, if you put another chap with a mustard yellow blazer and jeans in front of the blue door, you would have been a contender for the blue ribbon.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-09-03 12:00:35.</i></td>', 'Let me be the first to say, congrats on 3rd place. A well deserved first ribbon. ETA: As an aside, if you put another chap with a mustard yellow blazer and jeans in front of the blue door, you would have been a contender for the blue ribbon.', '2008-09-03 12:33:21.000000', '2008-09-03 13:00:35.000000', 0),
(4931404, 712077, 28742, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your belated ribbon!!</td>', 'Congrats on your belated ribbon!!', '2008-09-03 14:17:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(4931430, 711874, 86447, '<td valign="top">Oh.  I''m so very sorry about your DQ.   *sigh*</td>', 'Oh.  I''m so very sorry about your DQ.   *sigh*', '2008-09-03 14:27:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(4931672, 711874, 61961, '<td valign="top">So sorry to hear about the disqualification.  Still a lovely shot.  I hope you don''t let this discourage you!</td>', 'So sorry to hear about the disqualification.  Still a lovely shot.  I hope you don''t let this discourage you!', '2008-09-03 15:44:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(4931680, 711874, 90495, '<td valign="top">awww this sucks big time Caroline. I don''t get it though. What DQed this?</td>', 'awww this sucks big time Caroline. I don''t get it though. What DQed this?', '2008-09-03 15:48:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(4931744, 711874, 60862, '<td valign="top">Oh, no!  Well, don''t take the DQ too hard. It''s still a great shot, and people make editing mistakes pretty regularly.  Just learn what was wrong and avoid it going forward.</td>', 'Oh, no!  Well, don''t take the DQ too hard. It''s still a great shot, and people make editing mistakes pretty regularly.  Just learn what was wrong and avoid it going forward.', '2008-09-03 16:04:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(4932623, 710927, 37719, '<td valign="top">I really like the simplicity of the composition - minimal, yet it still has this feeling of strength with the stone and both are complimented quite nicely by the little girl.  Very well done!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-09-03 20:57:06.</i></td>', 'I really like the simplicity of the composition - minimal, yet it still has this feeling of strength with the stone and both are complimented quite nicely by the little girl.  Very well done!', '2008-09-03 21:56:27.000000', '2008-09-03 21:57:06.000000', 0),
(4933984, 711216, 73564, '<td valign="top">I like the colors here, nice angle captured.</td>', 'I like the colors here, nice angle captured.', '2008-09-04 12:13:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(4934164, 711874, 74015, '<td valign="top">WHAT!!!!  Note to self: lens correction tool = STRETCHING the image!<br/> <br/>What a bummer! *sigh*  Well they say the best way to learn is the hard way.  This one is hard enough - I think the lesson will stick for good :(</td>', 'WHAT!!!!  Note to self: lens correction tool = STRETCHING the image! What a bummer! *sigh*  Well they say the best way to learn is the hard way.  This one is hard enough - I think the lesson will stick for good :(', '2008-09-04 13:40:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(4934178, 710566, 68504, '<td valign="top">Really like this.  The understatement (soft tones, POV, everydayness of the room) make the beauty and grace of the nude figure that much more real and friendly.</td>', 'Really like this.  The understatement (soft tones, POV, everydayness of the room) make the beauty and grace of the nude figure that much more real and friendly.', '2008-09-04 13:45:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(4936432, 711680, 3746, '<td valign="top">gave this a 7.. good find and well shot.</td>', 'gave this a 7.. good find and well shot.', '2008-09-05 14:27:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(4938048, 712066, 11854, '<td valign="top">That is one of the most bizarre set of doors I''ve ever seen. Love it! Are they really as "skinny" as they seem? Don''t they have fat people in Germany? ROFL!</td>', 'That is one of the most bizarre set of doors I''ve ever seen. Love it! Are they really as "skinny" as they seem? Don''t they have fat people in Germany? ROFL!', '2008-09-06 10:58:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(4940751, 712066, 20849, '<td valign="top">An excellent, tight, interesting arrangement of windows &amp; doors - composition is enjoyable. I could not say if the physically unnatural, moire effect, causing the rototilled walls is in your file. If it is, the picture is remarkable.<br/>undieyatch@frostypaws<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-09-07 21:56:44.</i></td>', 'An excellent, tight, interesting arrangement of windows & doors - composition is enjoyable. I could not say if the physically unnatural, moire effect, causing the rototilled walls is in your file. If it is, the picture is remarkable.undieyatch@frostypaws', '2008-09-07 22:55:12.000000', '2008-09-07 22:56:44.000000', 0),
(4953540, 711978, 52296, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the blue Artur, well done, great shot !!!</td>', 'Congrats on the blue Artur, well done, great shot !!!', '2008-09-13 13:20:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(4960728, 712248, 39007, '<td valign="top">Very cool ;)</td>', 'Very cool ;)', '2008-09-17 20:40:16.000000', NULL, 0),
